Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,86.4)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,626.4)}{\an7}Beauty - Health - Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Nope... Nuh-uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:13.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,I heard you mumbling in here. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:17.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's just that they\Nhaven't lost much weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you think I should- whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:21.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,What's with the outfit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:24.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I bought some new gear,\Nso I wanted to show it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:28.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, for yoga?\NYou've been way into it lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine opened up a new studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:31.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,216)}{\an7}Hot Yoga Studio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:33.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Drop by sometime and give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:35.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,You can rent the place out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:43.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:39.58,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,468)}{\an7}Closed for Private Event
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:41.38,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,604.8)}{\an7}Otherworldly Beings and Super Spicy Poses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hi, ladies. It's nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:43.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Why'd ya dwag us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:48.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, now... He says it'll help us lose weight.\NWhere's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:51.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Shut your twap!\NI don't give a wat's ass, so wemme go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:53.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's uncomfortably warm in this building...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn into merrow jerky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:59.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,You told us to meet you here\Nfor a workout session,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,but what exactly are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:03.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are we boxing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:04.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:06.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Then... are we dancing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:08.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this a torture chamber?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:13.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, for real?\NThese losers must live under a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:15.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you know what we're doing, Oga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,In that case, do you mind...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:19.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll give 'em the rundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.58,0:02:21.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.25,0:02:24.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,So ya finawwy caved, eh, human?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:30.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, it's not a bribe!\NIt's clothes and towels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:33.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,There are lockers in the back,\Nso feel free to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:36.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Alright, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:42.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,'Kay, we're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wh-wh-why are you naked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:49.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,'Cause it's a sauna. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:54.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Time to bare our souls, amirite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,In my case, it's bare-bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I wonder where the ice baths are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:03.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,A friendly word of advice:\Nput a towel down before you sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:07.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,That is, if you don't want to embarrass yourself\Nlike that flab-biscuit of an elf over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey! You did exactly the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ladies! Put your clothes back on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me, you potato-headed pissant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:18.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're the one who started it,\NButt-cheeks McGee!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,This is quite the pickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:26.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Mr. Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:29.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Just forget about them and crank up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's NOT a sauna!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now PLEASE get dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Hot yoga"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh! I read about yoga in\Na dieting book once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:43.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's a type of fitness training that emphasizes\Nphysical posture and breathing techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,When practiced in a high-heat,\Nhigh-humidity environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:49.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,it's referred to as "hot yoga."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:51.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's completely differ'nt than\Nwhat the ogre told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:55.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Saunas are hot and humid,\Nso it's close enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,In a manner of speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:04:01.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm down for anything, but...\Nwill it help us lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:06.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,It can also reduce inflammation,\Nresulting in a slimmer face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:07.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,A slim face...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:11.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yoga makes it easier to lose weight\Nby boosting your metabolism.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's a popular form of exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:18.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone stand on top of your yoga mats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:21.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is imitate my poses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:23.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:27.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,But what if we can't?\NMy body isn't very flexible...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Not a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,We'll start with some poses that are\Nsuitable for everyone, even beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:39.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I want each of you to sit\Ncross-legged on your mat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Does that count as cross-legged?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:46.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, she IS sitting.\NA dog can only do so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:47.58,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,540)}{\an7}I'm not a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:52.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,This is a foundational yoga pose\Ncalled "Sukhasana."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's important to avoid canting\Nyour pelvis forward or backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:59.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,A pelvic tilt can cause\Nyour stomach to stick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:00.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's perfect, Kuroeda!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:07.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Try to copy the way she's keeping\Nher hips flat against the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:10.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,The hell are you smirking at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't get bent out of shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:15.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Focus on your posture and\Nyour breathing, and relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:22.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Relax your shoulders...\NTake controlled breaths...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:25.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,This pose is often used\Nduring meditation, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:28.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm all sweaty and we aren't even moving...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.08,0:05:30.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shrivel up and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to drink plenty of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:34.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:36.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:39.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Let's move on to some poses that\Ntarget specific areas of the body!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:43.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,This one's pretty tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:47.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Supine Spinal Twist" is a pose\Nthat improves digestion
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:49.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,and can also boost your metabolism.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm shaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:53.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm sweating up a storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:59.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Chair Pose" is effective for tightening,\Nsculpting, and strengthening the lower body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:04.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Raising your arms into "Crescent Moon Pose"\Nstretches your shoulders and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:07.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,It bends your spine into\Nthe shape of a crescent moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:09.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,It does wonders for my stiff shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:15.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Downward-Facing Dog" is beneficial for\Ntoning your arms, calves, and hamstrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:18.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,My arms are wobblin' like jelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,By training your core muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:26.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Tree Pose" can be an effective way to\Nreduce inflammation and sensitivity to cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:28.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,It utilizes your whole body!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:32.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I think I'd wike it even better if\Nit was "Money Twee Pose"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:37.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,The gang's all here...\NWhat are they up to in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,What's that pose called?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:40.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Lion Pose."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Lion...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:44.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not called "Piggy Pose"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:48.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aw, do I look like a cute little piggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oink-hee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:51.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I don't think it was a compliment...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:54.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me if I'm doing this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:58.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Mr. Human, could you take a look\Nat my pose next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:01.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:06.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Th-they're showing off a bunch of sexy poses\Nin front of the human...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:08.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whoa, one at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:12.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I can't help but notice that\Nyou're all soaked in sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,I didn't wear you out, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,S-soaked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,W-wear them out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.17,0:07:25.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,M-my poor, innocent psyche!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow, you ladies really catch on quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're making fantastic progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:30.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:33.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Aw, shucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:36.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh man... It's hard to stay balanced...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:38.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's because you're a little stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Go slowly, but try not to overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hmmmmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,You'll get it eventually!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.75,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,244.8)}{\an7}SMACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend like you\Nweren't picking a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll punt your big balloon belly\Ninto outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:08:00.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll make sure you leave with your\Nenormous ass even more swollen than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:04.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're going to distract everyone!\NTake it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,They're at each other's throats again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:08.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Awfully tempermental, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Atta girl, giving it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:14.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,'Cause I want more pwesents\Nfwom kids at the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whaddya call that pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:19.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's "Happy Baby Pose."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Happy baby...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness gracious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna be a wittle baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Then I'll gladly be your mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:31.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wet me go! I can't bweathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:35.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,You should never force your way\Ninto a child's personal space.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,She's wight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:39.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,The cycwops has way better\Nmotherwy instincts than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:42.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Kids call 'em like they see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:44.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:48.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, anyone with eyes can see\Nthat MY people are the superior species.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:51.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,If it's a fight you want,\Nit's a fight you'll get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:53.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,The winner is her REAL mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:56.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sure, fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:09:00.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,We never declared a winner\Nafter our boxing match the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:02.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't I get a say in this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:05.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Only because we ran out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:07.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Technically speaking, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,You got vision problems or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:13.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,No matter how you slice it, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Not them too...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,W-wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Stop! Cut it out, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:40.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,All I wanted was for us to do yoga\Nand have fun in a healthy way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:42.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,How did it turn into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:43.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:47.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,It looks like Honeda's completely\Nunbothered by the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,And her form...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's like she's a yoga master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I won't back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,W-watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,She dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:09:59.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Like a TRUE yoga master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I heard the Dragon Slenderer's voice just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:07.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is he experimenting with a new technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,She's speaking inside my mind...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:12.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Dragon Slenderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:16.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,I would like to learn this\Nnew technique of yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Teach me and I shall reward you with riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:20.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wiches, you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:23.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yo, dragon. This is a yoga studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:24.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,You gotta take those off first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:26.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Why are you getting undressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:32.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I meant your shoes, not your pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Horns and a tail...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:36.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is she a dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:38.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,And a pudgy one at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Shh! That's very rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:44.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Come now, human. The technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Human? Wait, is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,H-he's out like a light!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, look closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:59.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's... "Corpse Pose"!
